# Decisiones cacheadas del LLM y registro de ordenes: datos locales, no codigo.
# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `portfolio/` also matched the source package
# src/invest_ll/portfolio/, which is how that package never reached git.
/decisions/
/ledger/
/forecasts/
/attempts/
/portfolio/
/research/runs/
# paper/ is tracked on purpose: a forward-test record committed before the outcome is
# known is the only proof that it was not fitted afterwards.

# Basura que dejan pytest y hypothesis en el directorio de trabajo (Windows).
# No es codigo del proyecto: el test que los provoca no toca disco.
pytest-of-*/
tmp[a-z0-9]*

# Estado interno del consejo de sabios: la transcripcion cruda del debate no es
# documentacion. El reporte legible se guarda en docs/.
.consejo/
consejo-debate-*.jsonl
